{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0244_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6be062df4bcc6162f89fddd1a9a78586ff57845fd7c748026687b398f7f906d5", "ja": "お疲れ、ジュリア。ブログ読んだよ。\n衣装の評判、いい感じだな！", "zh": "辛苦了，茱莉亚。我看过博客了。\n服装的评价很不错啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0244_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "39c9f22442db2e5ed5a3943230f6ea79e864405982bed5854f73394dddb89d50", "ja": "お、みんなもうコメントくれてんのか？\nサンキュ、あとで見とくよ。", "zh": "哦，大家已经都留言了吗？\n谢啦，晚点我会看的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0244_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "9e996b9c51fe0798af33dd729b22ba6fbea6562b07dcd86b39afe53d32532423", "ja": "けどホント、良く出来てるよな、この衣装。\nメチャクチャ細かいよ、この飾りとか……。", "zh": "不过说真的，这套服装做得真好啊。\n像这些装饰……细节做得特别足。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0244_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "54abe633b0b46799f3648734d267d2433f9be3498912fb0b86fcb1df8ee31285", "ja": "それに、見た目より動きやすいんだよな。\nマジですごいぜ、これ。", "zh": "而且穿起来比看上去更方便活动。\n这件衣服真的很厉害。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0244_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b5ce484614cfbc4c08c80db4b57074736f0c721da9582c945d34359fe1eb2d92", "ja": "気に入ってくれたみたいでよかった。\n問題ないって、青羽さんにも伝えておこう。", "zh": "你喜欢就好。\n我也去跟青羽小姐说一声，告诉她没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0244_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "6ca0d9a7ce2c1d7157d548dce7720a5b9aea23eb11c85d2bfaf7ce4f6d1bef58", "ja": "あ……なあ、{$P$}。\nえっと……これって、レイとお揃いなんだよな？", "zh": "啊……那个，{$P$}。\n呃……这个是和玲音配套的，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0244_1006_p", "source_sha256": "4f5c221c453cd048f549f5b7d626ea4303a1b2f0ebf2b14264cd6519e51adb0f", "ja": "ん？　まあ、そうだな。お揃いって言うか、\n一対のデザインだよ。そういうコンセプトだから。", "zh": "嗯？这个嘛，算是吧。与其说是同款，不如说是成对的设计。因为概念就是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0244_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "6c3f4731b578585c7cb11351472329b05a86754d99cb62ca20dd40e2c19abf6b", "ja": "そうだよな。\nんー……あー……。", "zh": "是啊。\n嗯……啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0244_1008_p", "source_sha256": "f8f9c91f3e547e87b9f3cf50497912c289ce89e08f7a2f4ad125804b20ff1201", "ja": "どうした？　なにか気になることでもあるのか？", "zh": "怎么了？是有什么在意的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0244_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "fd2bf07e2545b462893670bfacc85d28289a601c0f966385457cf37bff12e69b", "ja": "いや、気になるっつーか……。\nレイと並んだ時のこと、想像しちゃってさ。", "zh": "不是在意什么，只是……  \n我忍不住想象了一下，和玲站在一起时的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0244_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "1b0689d6d59ede75a9bc0ea3f8873bc740fbb506c59252b7c1e76aca432ba96b", "ja": "レイは背が高いし、手足も長いけど、\nあたしは、その……普通じゃん？", "zh": "丽花个子高，四肢也修长，可我嘛……不就是个普通人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0244_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "2240a40b20c7102a8cbbed4693127a74a1b5833a52cec24197db7a6fd95ea944", "ja": "比べられた時、あたしだけ浮かないかなって……。\nそういう心配をちょっとね。", "zh": "要是被拿来比较，我会不会显得格格不入啊……\n就是有点担心这个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0244_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "964e8183704868b4a601dd7b73a73a4a237f585f729941091a10319b18ca190c", "ja": "っと……わ、悪い、忘れてくれ！　らしくなかった。\nこの衣装は気に入ったよ、ホント！", "zh": "呃……抱、抱歉，忘了吧！真不像我。\n我很喜欢这套服装，真的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0244_1013_p", "source_sha256": "2c8d23e71ee12c8175effb0df5e0a7786b5c4d670461f23e2af0ff321d095f73", "ja": "いや……ジュリア。今言ったけど、\nその衣装はお揃いじゃなくて、対なんだ。", "zh": "不……茱莉亚。刚才也说过了，\n那套服装不是同款，而是一对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0244_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "c4e3397bec76f54a387efc48aea4c9b0d4022eb1f6a4b547ae9ee0ab221590be", "ja": "え？　どう違うんだ、それ。", "zh": "诶？这有什么不同吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0244_1015_p", "source_sha256": "c17b874033adc1074297885213d8f504c0d5ac5bcb6732a8ea6fe16b34d54bc6", "ja": "揃ってなくていいって事。\nむしろ、合わせようとしないで欲しいな。", "zh": "意思是不必完全一致。\n倒希望你们不要刻意去配合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0244_1016_p", "source_sha256": "685d7de4e2175fe23ba27f48a86709479c81637a693a219893caea3fe834913d", "ja": "今回のコンセプトはお互いの影の部分、『もうひとりの\n自分』だ。それは、全く同じって意味じゃない。", "zh": "这次的主题是彼此阴暗的一面，也就是“另一个自己”。并不是说两个人要完全一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0244_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "2e24dad5398b3217540b1a7fdf8a9c1feda7c6d9ed6073efa2e7d712ee01aa92", "ja": "あ……そっか！　あたし、レイに合わせようとしてた。\nははっ、なんだよ。マジでらしくなかったな。", "zh": "啊……原来如此！我刚才一直想配合玲音。\n哈哈，说什么呢。真不像我啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0244_1018_p", "source_sha256": "715f396075975505f8b4c9c500c31000f6c8fc4b5043005876fecf45eca75058", "ja": "ああ。ジュリアはジュリアらしくていい！\n衣装を用意する時は、いつもそのつもりだぞ。", "zh": "是啊。茱莉亚就该像茱莉亚那样才好！\n准备服装时，我一直都是这么想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0244_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "471c2e71c38fb1bd4a9aa290974cdf1e38eef3ffcbab67ff616c364928f64529", "ja": "ったく……あたしらしく、か。好きなフレーズだ。\nあんたホント、あたしをノセるのが上手いよな！", "zh": "真是的……“做自己”吗？我喜欢这句话。你还真是很会让我来劲啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0244_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "690057808dce7b6ee2cb24ddc347df834ed601cb4b561b7a67cf62d2f65fe74b", "ja": "わかったよ。だったらせいぜい、\nあたしらしく暴れさせてもらうとするか。", "zh": "知道了。既然如此，那我就尽情按照自己的风格大闹一场吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0244_1021_050jul", "source_sha256": "09a2a8fd5cc61c658eac12351145a67946604f04e174b2866c5eaa8ef3dc1850", "ja": "あたしをノセたんだから、あんたも覚悟しろよ？\n目、離せなくしてやるから……なんてな♪", "zh": "既然是你让我兴奋起来的，那你也做好心理准备吧？\n我会让你目不转睛地盯着看……开玩笑的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
